  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Whenever one of your units with **Martial Ka’tah** is picked to fight, choose a **Ka’tah Stance** for it. That Stance is active, and the unit holds its ability, only until the unit's attacks are all resolved. **Dacatari Stance**: the unit's models get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** on their melee weapons. **Rendax Stance**: the unit's models get **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** on their melee weapons.",
